    "title": "At the National Board of Review Gala, Leonardo DiCaprio, Michael B. Jordan, and Rose Byrne Paid Homage to the Power of Cinema - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Danielle Naer ,\n14 hours ago You know awards season is underway when the marble floors and cathedral-like ceilings of Cipriani 42nd Street are reverberating with cinephile chatter: “What did you love? What’s overrated? Who gave a career best? What’s your sleeper hit?” The National Board of Review’s annual awards gala returned on Tuesday evening, bringing a troupe of directors, actors, and familiar faces from Hollywood to the storied Manhattan venue. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
